<title>INDIA: India's BPL Cellular withdraws ADR issue.</title>
<headline>India's BPL Cellular withdraws ADR issue.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fledgling Indian telecom firm BPL Cellular Holdings said on Thursday it was withdrawing its international equity issue.</p>
<p>The issue of American Depositary Receipts was to have been India's first.</p>
<p>&quot;We have withdrawn the issue,&quot; a company official said from the firm's Bangalore headquarters.</p>
<p>He said more details would be made available shortly.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
